letely unusual for things like this to take a bit more time, but this license is indeed taking longer than I'd expect :)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/943562518/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/954040258","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1332#issuecomment-954040258","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1332","id":954040258,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE8443X_C","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-10-28T17:11:55Z","updated_at":"2021-10-28T17:11:55Z","body":"we will wait on OSI. Moving to 3.16 release","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/954040258/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/989998354","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1332#issuecomment-989998354","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1332","id":989998354,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE847Ai0S","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-12-09T16:13:10Z","updated_at":"2021-12-09T16:13:44Z","body":"Not sure about OSI review status, but I'd lean towards including this. I'm not doing a full inclusion principles analysis at the moment, but very roughly:\r\n\r\n* looks to me like it meets OSD principles -- although there isn't an explicit statement of \"you may modify,\" it includes a requirement that modifications be clearly marked, so implicitly it appears to permit modifications\r\n* as a historical license, although it looks to have been used primarily for Perforce Jam, it looks like that has been used as part of Boost and made its way into various other real-world projects and products, e.g.:\r\n  * https://www.boost.org/doc/libs/1_35_0/doc/html/jam.html\r\n  * https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/td/docs/security/vpn_client/anyconnect/anyconnect44/license/open_source/Open_Source_Used_in_Cisco_AnyConnect_Secure_Mobility_Client_4-4.html (at 1.4.1)\r\n  * https://static.dc.siemens.com/cnc4you/OSS_Documents/ReadMe_OSS_SinuTrain_for_SINUMERIK_Operate_4.7-ed4.htm (it's a massive list of licenses / copyrights but I see it in there)\r\n\r\nso I'd be a +1 to add it. Given the notes that the project ended in 2014, I doubt there's a relevant license steward at this stage and I wouldn't be inclined to version it.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/989998354/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/990099309","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1332#issuecomment-990099309","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1332","id":990099309,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE847A7dt","user":{"login":"seabass-labrax","id":79224200,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MjI0MjAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/79224200?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/seabass-labrax","html_url":"https://github.com/seabass-labrax","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seabass-labrax/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seabass-labrax/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seabass-labrax/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seabass-labrax/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seabass-labrax/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seabass-labrax/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seabass-labrax/repos","eve